    <innerclass refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_i_storage_ops_policy" prot="public">themis::storage::IStorageOpsPolicy</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis">themis</innernamespace>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis_1_1storage">themis::storage</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract storage-operations policy for background jobs, compaction, and snapshots in ThemisDB. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Governs three storage-operation axes: concurrent background maintenance jobs, compaction I/O throughput, and simultaneous snapshot operations. Sits in Tier 2 of the four-tier resource-governance chain:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">compile-time<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">constexpr</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(edition.h)<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/>absolute<sp/>ceiling,<sp/>never<sp/>overridable</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">RuntimeLicenseGate<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/>edition-tier<sp/>ceiling</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">IStorageOpsPolicy<sp/><sp/><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">this</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>file)<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">signed</highlight><highlight class="normal">-plugin<sp/>fine-tuning</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">StorageOpsConfig<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/>per-deployment<sp/>operational<sp/>tuning</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>All implementations must be individually thread-safe.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This interface is part of the edition-policy plugin contract (IEditionPolicyPlugin::createStorageOpsPolicy). Claimed limits are validated against the compile-time ceilings in <ref refid="edition_8h" kindref="compound">edition.h</ref> (STORAGE_MAX_BACKGROUND_JOBS, STORAGE_MAX_COMPACTION_BYTES_PER_SEC, STORAGE_MAX_CONCURRENT_SNAPSHOTS) before EditionManager accepts the policy. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
